  "schema": "harbor.joint-reopen.owner-qualification/v1",
  "question": "Can two independently controlled Harbor seats choose when to acquire private and peer information? Can an observer identify which operation the harness last reported while a team is unfinished, without seeing the calendar or assigning blame?",
  "task": {
    "name": "harbor/joint-reopen",
